<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const reviewDetailsUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = reviewDetailsUser.fullName || 'Landlord'; %>
    <%- include('../../partials/sidebar-landlord') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Landlord workspace</p><p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p></div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/user-profile" aria-label="Landlord profile" title="Landlord profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <a class="mb-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/user/landlord/properties"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>Back to Properties</a>
          <p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Property setup</p>
          <h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Review and publish</h1>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">A public listing needs a complete saved draft, an immutable preview, policy checks, and an auditable publication lifecycle.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="publish-step-status-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">unpublished</span>
              <div><p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Step status</p><h2 id="publish-step-status-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Review and publication are not connected</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">There is no property draft, readiness service, public preview, moderation result, publish endpoint, listing record, status history, or rollback path.</p></div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Step 5 unavailable</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section class="border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-10 text-center sm:px-8" aria-labelledby="publish-step-title">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">preview_off</span>
              <p class="mt-4 text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Planned step 5 of 5</p>
              <h2 id="publish-step-title" class="mt-2 text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">No listing version is available to review</h2>
              <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No section is marked complete, no readiness percentage is calculated, and no property is presented as publishable without authoritative saved data.</p>
              <a class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 font-bold text-on-primary hover:opacity-90" href="/user/landlord/properties/add/address"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">first_page</span>Open setup start</a>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="publication-foundations-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="publication-foundations-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required publication foundations</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Publishing must be deliberate, repeatable, policy-aware, and reversible.</p></div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">fact_check</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Authoritative readiness</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Validate one saved draft against required fields, jurisdiction rules, ownership, current availability, file processing, and disclosure policy.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">visibility</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Immutable public preview</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Generate the exact public version with private fields excluded, warnings surfaced, accessible media, total costs, and a stable revision ID.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Authorized publication</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Require an authorized landlord, confirmation of the reviewed version, idempotent publishing, moderation outcomes, and clear failure recovery.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">history</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Listing lifecycle</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Track draft, review, published, paused, expired, let, archived, and removed states with actor, reason, timestamp, correction, and rollback.</p></article>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="planned-review-groups-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="planned-review-groups-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Planned review groups</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">These areas remain unavailable until a complete draft can produce a trustworthy preview.</p></div>
              <dl class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Property identity and public location</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Listing content and fair-listing checks</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Rent, total costs, and availability</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Public media and private document separation</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Review and publication boundaries">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="publish-actions-title">
              <h2 id="publish-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Action availability</h2>
              <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Review saved draft</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Preview public version</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Publish listing</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Pause or roll back</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-error bg-error-container p-6" aria-labelledby="publication-privacy-title"><h2 id="publication-privacy-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-error-container">Do not publish private details</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-error-container">Full addresses, access codes, ownership records, identity data, tenant information, applicant evidence, contact details, and private documents must never enter the public listing version.</p></section>

            <section class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="publication-status-title"><h2 id="publication-status-title" class="font-bold text-on-surface">No false public status</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A review page, preview, or successful browser interaction does not mean a listing is published. Public status needs a saved record and a server-confirmed lifecycle event.</p></section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
